+
+## 4. What the office does about `phoebe-dev`
+
+The Viche deployment lives on `phoebe-dev` under the Lubko/S6 container (`deploy/DEPLOYMENT.md`). Latest recorded disk state there (`records/RESOURCE-2026-10-14.md`): **78% used, ~50 G free of 233 G**, a shared-host condition; Viche's own footprint ~3 MB. Because the office runs from `government/boot.sh`, it will begin recording live `phoebe-dev` observations on the **next S6 cycle after this branch is merged to `main`** (the constitutional boot fast-forwards the canonical checkout each cycle). No new S6 service, privileged operation, or host-side provisioning is required.
